## Igni Sprite

An Igni Sprite is a humanoid mass of magma and fire that lives in the underground rivers of lava. They keep below the surface, and come up when the molten rock is stirred, climbing out onto whatever walkway or platform is at hand and going for whoever stands there. One opens its jaw wide and lets out a burst of cold mist around itself.
